// pfodWeb NOTE: excludes GPIO38 - onboard NeoPixel power-gate
// (NEOPIXEL_POWER, see vendor pins_arduino.h; driven automatically by the
// Arduino core per Adafruit's own pinouts page). GPIO39 (NeoPixel data)
// stays available, tagged led_neopixel, matching the qtpy_esp32/qtpy_esp32s2
// precedent. GPIO0 (BOOT button, readable as input-with-pullup per Adafruit's
// Learn guide) tagged button. See boardsDetails notes.txt for full sourcing.
{
